<title>UK: WestLB sets NZ$100 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets NZ$100 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    09.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.72    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	DEAL IS LAUNCHED IN THE NAME OF WESTLB FINANCE</p>
<p>		CURACAO NV AND GAURANTEED BY WESTLB GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p>	     **US/UK/NZ/NETERLANDS ANTILLES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
